"key":"verification_status","html":"source-and-argument-reviewed"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(D_\\varepsilon,R_\\varepsilon)\">\\((D_\\varepsilon,R_\\varepsilon)\\)</span> 如 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"069c67d72b4fb710\" href=\"?note=069c67d72b4fb710\" title=\"72-df-epsilon-0-notation\">72-df-epsilon-0-notation</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Acc}_R\">\\(\\mathrm{Acc}_R\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"839f229fc9fb3b6f\" href=\"?note=839f229fc9fb3b6f\" title=\"72-df-accessible-ordinal\">72-df-accessible-ordinal</a> 的最小前驱闭包。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Acc}_{R_\\varepsilon}=D_\\varepsilon.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Acc}_{R_\\varepsilon}=D_\\varepsilon.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>若可及部分的补非空，由实际良序的最小元原理取最小不可及代码a；其所有前驱可及，故闭包定义使a可及，矛盾。所用实际良序来自上一引理，不把代码可生成性当作良基性证明。ε0不是本代码系统内的元素。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-accessible-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"839f229fc9fb3b6f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-accessible-ordinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-lem-epsilon-0-notation","status":"resolved","id":"3e21ee2923aace9a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-lem-epsilon-0-notation]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-epsilon-0-notation","status":"resolved","id":"069c67d72b4fb710","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-epsilon-0-notation]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-epsilon-0-notation","status":"resolved","id":"069c67d72b4fb710","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$(D_\\varepsilon,R_\\varepsilon)$ 如 [[72-df-epsilon-0-notation]]，$\\mathrm{Acc}_R$ 为 [[72-df-accessible-ordinal]] 的最小前驱闭包。","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-accessible-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"839f229fc9fb3b6f","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$(D_\\varepsilon,R_\\varepsilon)$ 如 [[72-df-epsilon-0-notation]]，$\\mathrm{Acc}_R$ 为 [[72-df-accessible-ordinal]] 的最小前驱闭包。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"(D_\\varepsilon,R_\\varepsilon)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Acc}_R","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Acc}_{R_\\varepsilon}=D_\\varepsilon.","display":true}],"bytes":1165,"backlinks":[{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-189","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-thm-epsilon-0-accessible|prop-epsilon-0-accessible — Epsilon 0 Accessible Proposition]]"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-189","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./72-thm-epsilon-0-accessible|prop-epsilon-0-accessible — Epsilon 0 Accessible Proposition]]"}],"outgoing":["839f229fc9fb3b6f","3e21ee2923aace9a","069c67d72b4fb710"]}